# Pairs with BulkCloseMeetsCoreClose (B -> C, #5839): the bulk switch's close covers every prior
# allocation, the range's earlier records included, as the core's lazy-arm close assumes.
MODULE: BulkCloseMeetsCoreCloseHeadUncovered
TARGET: BulkCloseMeetsCoreClose
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: SwitchCloseCoversPriorAllocations is dropped, so the bulk close records a head at or below a record the range held before the birth

--- FIND
    /\ SwitchCloseCoversPriorAllocations
    /\ hoOpen' = FALSE
--- REPLACE
    /\ hoOpen' = FALSE
--- END
